<title>THAILAND: Deposit run on troubled Thai finance firms slows.</title>
<headline>Deposit run on troubled Thai finance firms slows.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Runs on deposits at 10 troubled Thai finance firms, which were told this week by the central bank to raise capital, has slowed down, a central bank official said on Friday.</p>
</text>
